{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 12194871757914752239,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Github App for pushing to github from the dev-desktops",
      "source_hash": 4450905398234731355,
      "context_hash": 10426774831230664028,
      "translation": "dev-desktop에서 github로 푸시하기 위한 Github App",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697414Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "These instructions are for server-side setup and debugging of the dev-desktop github app.",
      "source_hash": 4357121367627665753,
      "context_hash": 1447890842917141585,
      "translation": "이 지침은 dev-desktop github app의 서버 측 설정과 디버깅을 위한 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The user only needs to be directed to the app installation URL and everything should just work for them.",
      "source_hash": 12672898577341901250,
      "context_hash": 14853442241490425373,
      "translation": "사용자는 앱 설치 URL로 안내받기만 하면 되며, 나머지는 모두 자동으로 동작해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "We're using the python github library for all github operations.",
      "source_hash": 2868336123689076863,
      "context_hash": 9214947299323843243,
      "translation": "모든 github 작업에는 python github 라이브러리를 사용하고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "You can find the docs at https://pygithub.readthedocs.io/en/latest/introduction.html",
      "source_hash": 3049258905446991888,
      "context_hash": 17697434249932334454,
      "translation": "문서는 https://pygithub.readthedocs.io/en/latest/introduction.html 에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How to setup an App",
      "source_hash": 8864517775512552414,
      "context_hash": 16225016097142798642,
      "translation": "App 설정 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Go to https://github.com/settings/apps",
      "source_hash": 5300916172716198123,
      "context_hash": 12889240944437948550,
      "translation": "https://github.com/settings/apps 로 이동하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "New Github App",
      "source_hash": 2898538724265095227,
      "context_hash": 968026052512226345,
      "translation": "New Github App",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Fill out metadata (name and url)",
      "source_hash": 15303274130557172335,
      "context_hash": 2218406587164965366,
      "translation": "메타데이터(이름과 url)를 입력하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "disable WebHook checkbox",
      "source_hash": 13981657339418565901,
      "context_hash": 3215773891718911324,
      "translation": "WebHook 체크박스를 비활성화하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Set `Contents - Repository contents, commits, branches, downloads, releases, and merges.` to read/write",
      "source_hash": 13782231812825069447,
      "context_hash": 10461562477475181762,
      "translation": "`Contents - Repository contents, commits, branches, downloads, releases, and merges.`를 읽기/쓰기로 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Set `Workflows - Update GitHub Action workflow files.` to read/write",
      "source_hash": 6982818818802226851,
      "context_hash": 18384539243710801168,
      "translation": "`Workflows - Update GitHub Action workflow files.`를 읽기/쓰기로 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Set to \"enable on any account\"",
      "source_hash": 6762901026084118619,
      "context_hash": 13794210201381427615,
      "translation": "\"enable on any account\"로 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Create App",
      "source_hash": 5003175964131963055,
      "context_hash": 5615813827358677747,
      "translation": "Create App",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697415Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Go to https://github.com/settings/apps/{your_app_name_here} and copy the `App ID` into `app_id.txt` (same folder as `gen_temp_access_token.py`)",
      "source_hash": 5682221261504098543,
      "context_hash": 16645716454757259502,
      "translation": "https://github.com/settings/apps/{your_app_name_here} 로 이동하여 `App ID`를 `app_id.txt`(`gen_temp_access_token.py`와 같은 폴더)에 복사하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "How to generate a .pem file for your App",
      "source_hash": 7936380801516363053,
      "context_hash": 2031216855701090539,
      "translation": "App용 .pem 파일 생성 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Go to https://github.com/settings/apps/{your_app_name_here}#private-key and generate a private key",
      "source_hash": 12461497698798442062,
      "context_hash": 2887628823398630643,
      "translation": "https://github.com/settings/apps/{your_app_name_here}#private-key 로 이동하여 개인 키를 생성하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Download starts, save it to somewhere private.",
      "source_hash": 877471264974969374,
      "context_hash": 5250311924441907078,
      "translation": "다운로드가 시작되면 안전한 위치에 저장하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "copy the .pem file into the same folder as the `gen_temp_access_token.py` and name it `dev-desktop.private-key.pem`",
      "source_hash": 5782459450941138941,
      "context_hash": 4794996213436722458,
      "translation": "`.pem` 파일을 `gen_temp_access_token.py`와 같은 폴더로 복사하여 `dev-desktop.private-key.pem`으로 이름을 지정합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": [
        "Inline code markers (`) count mismatch: source has 4, translation has 6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "How to install the app for a user",
      "source_hash": 1193272078138431089,
      "context_hash": 14725491315325246988,
      "translation": "사용자를 위한 앱 설치 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "direct the user to https://github.com/settings/apps/{your_app_name_here}/installations",
      "source_hash": 15362787216818334040,
      "context_hash": 16111613786493081789,
      "translation": "사용자를 https://github.com/settings/apps/{your_app_name_here}/installations 로 안내하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "let them install it on the org/user they want to and restrict to the repositories they want to use",
      "source_hash": 10015554071787305905,
      "context_hash": 3570524851573543050,
      "translation": "원하는 조직/사용자에 설치하도록 하고, 사용할 리포지토리로 제한하도록 하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "How to generate a temporary access token for a specific user",
      "source_hash": 10118699469955104527,
      "context_hash": 14887305473906692418,
      "translation": "특정 사용자를 위한 임시 액세스 토큰 생성 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "invoke `gen_temp_access_token.py <github_username> <github_repository_name>`",
      "source_hash": 6351472779232882271,
      "context_hash": 12258160081306646152,
      "translation": "`gen_temp_access_token.py <github_username> <github_repository_name>`를 실행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Integration into git command line",
      "source_hash": 5670581535416648184,
      "context_hash": 16506104056619949309,
      "translation": "git 명령줄과의 통합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We're using [credential-helpers](https://git-scm.com/docs/gitcredentials#Documentation/gitcredentials.txt).",
      "source_hash": 2496712754502513556,
      "context_hash": 2467357182989454645,
      "translation": "저희는 [credential-helpers](https://git-scm.com/docs/gitcredentials#Documentation/gitcredentials.txt)를 사용하고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For debugging a credential helper, have it in userspace and invoke it with",
      "source_hash": 16786038968182108074,
      "context_hash": 10883418050942321146,
      "translation": "credential helper를 디버깅하려면 이를 사용자 공간에 두고 다음과 같이 실행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`git -c credential.helper -c credential.UseHttpPath=true /path/to/helper push origin branch`",
      "source_hash": 11751421355386246936,
      "context_hash": 3181664287224772203,
      "translation": "`git -c credential.helper -c credential.UseHttpPath=true /path/to/helper push origin branch`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697416Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Note that this does not work for remotes that are registered with ssh urls.",
      "source_hash": 11590483780561896278,
      "context_hash": 2208704003179205302,
      "translation": "이는 ssh url로 등록된 원격 저장소에는 작동하지 않는다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697417Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "You must use https!",
      "source_hash": 10286224375893531738,
      "context_hash": 1881871095570043383,
      "translation": "반드시 https를 사용해야 합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697417Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The first command line argument is `get`, `store` or `remove`.",
      "source_hash": 8432609576737126748,
      "context_hash": 6246110799911649824,
      "translation": "첫 번째 명령줄 인자는 `get`, `store` 또는 `remove`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697417Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "In our case, we just abort (`exit(0)`) for everything but `get`, as we regenerate credentials on every invocation anyway.",
      "source_hash": 4684346578646501611,
      "context_hash": 17183629699608391572,
      "translation": "저희의 경우, 어차피 호출할 때마다 자격 증명을 재생성하므로 `get`을 제외한 모든 경우에는 그냥 중단합니다(`exit(0)`).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:22.697417Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The actual arguments are passed via stdin and usually look like",
      "source_hash": 14948864395330701840,
      "context_hash": 5692133474295969178,
      "translation": "실제 인자는 표준 입력을 통해 전달되며 보통 다음과 같은 형태입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:58.254867Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}